// Employees 10004 and 10005 have CASE=true but COALESCE=false, so they are excluded.
// All other employees have CASE=false and COALESCE=false, so they pass.
// Result: 3 (both true) + 95 (both false) = 98.
caseWithSingleColumnInSubqueryEqualsCoalesceWithMultiColumnInSubquery
